### Login (obter Bearer token) — senha do seed vem de SEED_USER_PASSWORD
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "leonan@fullcycle.com.br",
  "password": "troque-pela-SEED_USER_PASSWORD"
}

### Relatório financeiro administrativo (exige auth — 401 sem token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-report
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Deletar usuário (exige auth — 401 sem token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
